{
  "video_id": "vOhuf18b-g8",
  "whisper_model": "large-v3-turbo",
  "transcribe_seconds": 87.7,
  "audio_seconds": 430.1,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.5200000000000005,
      "text": "I thought with confidence that this would be the year that I finally switch over to a foldable phone.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14308815002441405,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.4575694167254238e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7259786476868328
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 6.5200000000000005,
      "end": 11.46,
      "text": "I've been testing these things for like seven or eight years, but I've never been drawn to one the way that I've been drawn to the Fold 7.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14308815002441405,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.4575694167254238e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7259786476868328
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 11.58,
      "end": 18.2,
      "text": "Because this is the first product that's been like, it looks and feels and has the weight and thickness of a regular phone.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14308815002441405,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.4575694167254238e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7259786476868328
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 18.36,
      "end": 25.1,
      "text": "It's just that when you want it to, you can open it up and it's like a bigger screen experience in a tablet-like device.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14308815002441405,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.4575694167254238e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7259786476868328
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 25.1,
      "end": 33.82,
      "text": "And I've been using this for two weeks. I thought for sure this would be the one, but I just, I don't like it nearly as much as I thought it would.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12322894009676846,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.153222563235529e-13,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6923076923076923
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 34.160000000000004,
      "end": 42.32,
      "text": "So in order to explain where I'm coming from, we have to go back a little bit and think about the origins of why we even are so enamored with foldable phones in the first place.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12322894009676846,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.153222563235529e-13,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6923076923076923
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 42.42,
      "end": 44.88,
      "text": "I think it just boils down to versatility, right?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12322894009676846,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.153222563235529e-13,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6923076923076923
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 45.02,
      "end": 51.64,
      "text": "We want a device that can be a phone when we want it to be and then a tablet for that big screen experience when we want it to be.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.12322894009676846,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.153222563235529e-13,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6923076923076923
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 51.64,
      "end": 58.3,
      "text": "And versatile tech, it's always so cool on paper, like a two-in-one tablet, right?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08430023603541877,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.7552812502097392e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6306306306306306
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 58.36,
      "end": 63.620000000000005,
      "text": "It's like the idea that you could have a tablet and a laptop in one product, but versatility also comes with the cost.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08430023603541877,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.7552812502097392e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6306306306306306
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 63.72,
      "end": 71.72,
      "text": "The cost of, I'm not talking about price, I'm talking about like you have engineering compromises that you have to make in order to have a multifunction device.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08430023603541877,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.7552812502097392e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6306306306306306
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 71.72,
      "end": 81.36,
      "text": "So in the two-in-one tablet, you have a tablet experience that's not perfect and you have a laptop experience that's not perfect, but you have a versatile two-in-one product.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08777549810576857,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.657179710297385e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 2.088495575221239
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 81.62,
      "end": 83.62,
      "text": "And the same thing has been the case with foldable phones.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08777549810576857,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.657179710297385e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 2.088495575221239
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 83.68,
      "end": 88.16,
      "text": "You have a phone experience that's typically not perfect because it's like a little bit thicker or whatever.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08777549810576857,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.657179710297385e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 2.088495575221239
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 88.4,
      "end": 93.66,
      "text": "And you also have a tablet experience that's also imperfect because there's things you have to do to be able to make it foldable.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08777549810576857,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.657179710297385e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 2.088495575221239
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 93.66,
      "end": 102.14,
      "text": "Now, on the Fold 7 this year, I think Samsung made the phone experience really good.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1291396306908649,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.7260078999728479e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6391304347826088
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 102.25999999999999,
      "end": 111.22,
      "text": "Like as close as possible to a regular slab phone because now it's like the same weight and same dimensions as a regular slab phone.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1291396306908649,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.7260078999728479e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6391304347826088
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 111.46,
      "end": 115.16,
      "text": "But in doing so, they had to make it really thin to do that, right?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1291396306908649,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.7260078999728479e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6391304347826088
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 115.28,
      "end": 120.32,
      "text": "In doing so, the tablet experience is noticeably worse than it was in previous generations.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1291396306908649,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.7260078999728479e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6391304347826088
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 120.32,
      "end": 127.55999999999999,
      "text": "So the first thing, right when I opened it from the box two weeks ago, I thought when I first unboxed it, I'm like,",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08026309941439021,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.801127281174375e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.764505119453925
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 127.63999999999999,
      "end": 131.4,
      "text": "huh, it's a little bit harder to open than previous generations.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08026309941439021,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.801127281174375e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.764505119453925
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 131.4,
      "end": 132.79999999999998,
      "text": "But I thought, you know, it's a new product.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08026309941439021,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.801127281174375e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.764505119453925
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 132.9,
      "end": 137.26,
      "text": "Maybe my Fold 6 has seen so much use that it got used to it, but it's not the case.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08026309941439021,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.801127281174375e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.764505119453925
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 137.35999999999999,
      "end": 143.38,
      "text": "I think two weeks later, it's just that the Fold 6, first of all, there's more material to grip onto when you do open it.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08026309941439021,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.801127281174375e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.764505119453925
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 143.38,
      "end": 146.64,
      "text": "But the hinge is just like, it's just built differently.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08026309941439021,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.801127281174375e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.764505119453925
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 146.79999999999998,
      "end": 148.29999999999998,
      "text": "It's like a nice, easy open.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08026309941439021,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.801127281174375e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.764505119453925
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 148.3,
      "end": 152.82000000000002,
      "text": "The Fold 7, for sure, this is a tougher product to hold, to open.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09207775977350051,
      "no_speech_prob": 2.0066715216565667e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6985507246376812
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 152.98000000000002,
      "end": 154.62,
      "text": "You gotta, you just gotta work it.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09207775977350051,
      "no_speech_prob": 2.0066715216565667e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6985507246376812
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 154.64000000000001,
      "end": 159.60000000000002,
      "text": "I'm surprised they didn't add some kind of like ledge or some kind of notch that you can work to just crank it open.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09207775977350051,
      "no_speech_prob": 2.0066715216565667e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6985507246376812
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 159.70000000000002,
      "end": 162.3,
      "text": "But there's less material to open when it's so thin, right?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09207775977350051,
      "no_speech_prob": 2.0066715216565667e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6985507246376812
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 162.62,
      "end": 168.66000000000003,
      "text": "Also, when you do open it, because it's so thin this year, we've lost the S Pen functionality, which I think disappointed a lot of people.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09207775977350051,
      "no_speech_prob": 2.0066715216565667e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6985507246376812
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 168.92000000000002,
      "end": 171.06,
      "text": "We don't have the under-display camera anymore.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09207775977350051,
      "no_speech_prob": 2.0066715216565667e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6985507246376812
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 171.22000000000003,
      "end": 173.18,
      "text": "We now have like the punch hole that's always there.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09207775977350051,
      "no_speech_prob": 2.0066715216565667e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6985507246376812
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 173.60000000000002,
      "end": 176.8,
      "text": "The speakers are noticeably worse this generation than the previous.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09207775977350051,
      "no_speech_prob": 2.0066715216565667e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6985507246376812
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 176.8,
      "end": 180.84,
      "text": "It's not like awful speakers, but they were quite good on the Fold 6 before.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14264754295349122,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.882256720278641e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5780590717299579
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 181.06,
      "end": 182.96,
      "text": "And we also have a massive camera bump.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14264754295349122,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.882256720278641e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5780590717299579
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 183.04000000000002,
      "end": 184.28,
      "text": "This protrudes out a lot.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14264754295349122,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.882256720278641e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5780590717299579
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 184.64000000000001,
      "end": 186.68,
      "text": "And the image quality is better this year.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14264754295349122,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.882256720278641e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5780590717299579
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 186.78,
      "end": 192.44,
      "text": "But to me, that improvement in image quality is so not worth the bulk that this camera system has added.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14264754295349122,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.882256720278641e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5780590717299579
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 192.74,
      "end": 194.52,
      "text": "You definitely need a case of some sort.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14264754295349122,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.882256720278641e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5780590717299579
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 194.64000000000001,
      "end": 196.06,
      "text": "The wobble on this thing is pretty severe.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.14264754295349122,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.882256720278641e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.5780590717299579
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 196.06,
      "end": 203.84,
      "text": "And I don't know, it just sticks out so much that I have a tough time calling this phone really thin because the hardware bump is no joke.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08746518586811267,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.4754066024469381e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.623015873015873
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 204.32,
      "end": 210.62,
      "text": "But despite all the quirks we've talked about, fundamentally, Samsung brought out something that was very impressive.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08746518586811267,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.4754066024469381e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.623015873015873
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 210.74,
      "end": 212.2,
      "text": "The hardware is amazing.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08746518586811267,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.4754066024469381e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.623015873015873
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 212.32,
      "end": 217.88,
      "text": "To be able to have a phone that is actually super thin like this but opens up into this big screen experience, it's impressive.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08746518586811267,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.4754066024469381e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.623015873015873
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 217.88,
      "end": 224.29999999999998,
      "text": "But we've got to talk about this whole big screen experience because this is what everyone's drawn to, right?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10176960489024287,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8102596244934377e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6942446043165467
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 224.35999999999999,
      "end": 226.54,
      "text": "The idea of that big screen experience.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10176960489024287,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8102596244934377e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6942446043165467
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 226.84,
      "end": 233.34,
      "text": "So right off the bat, this screen is awesome for like viewing documents and PDFs and like reading e-books.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10176960489024287,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8102596244934377e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6942446043165467
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 233.51999999999998,
      "end": 237.24,
      "text": "These are things that I never do, but it is a fantastic screen for that.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10176960489024287,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8102596244934377e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6942446043165467
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 237.82,
      "end": 240.94,
      "text": "Now, the other thing that Samsung pushes is the idea of multitasking.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10176960489024287,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8102596244934377e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6942446043165467
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 241.07999999999998,
      "end": 244.42,
      "text": "Like you get split screen and floating windows for multi-app workflows.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10176960489024287,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8102596244934377e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6942446043165467
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 244.42,
      "end": 246.22,
      "text": "The new software is awesome for that.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09804887038010818,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8648403134202685e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7903225806451613
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 246.32,
      "end": 248.17999999999998,
      "text": "But again, these are things that I don't really do.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09804887038010818,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8648403134202685e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7903225806451613
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 248.28,
      "end": 249.23999999999998,
      "text": "Like I thought I would.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09804887038010818,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8648403134202685e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7903225806451613
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 249.32,
      "end": 254.35999999999999,
      "text": "I thought I would at least at some point make use of it, but it's just not in my workflow.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09804887038010818,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8648403134202685e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7903225806451613
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 254.56,
      "end": 260.08,
      "text": "So I'm sure there's tons of people that do make use of multi-app workflows, like very productive, awesome people.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09804887038010818,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8648403134202685e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7903225806451613
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 260.2,
      "end": 264.78,
      "text": "But I'm just, I'm not that, I'm like a degenerate that watches videos, that looks at shorts.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09804887038010818,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8648403134202685e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7903225806451613
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 264.78,
      "end": 266.59999999999997,
      "text": "I look, like I browsed Reddit.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09804887038010818,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8648403134202685e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7903225806451613
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 266.8,
      "end": 268.15999999999997,
      "text": "I like message people.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09804887038010818,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8648403134202685e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7903225806451613
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 268.24,
      "end": 272.32,
      "text": "Like it's a very different thing from what I do compared to what we see in Samsung's ads.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.09804887038010818,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.8648403134202685e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.7903225806451613
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 272.32,
      "end": 279.28,
      "text": "And I use it and I'm like, why am I not able to make use of this multi-screen stuff?",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08764508744360695,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.5205106054447248e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6947040498442367
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "start": 279.34,
      "end": 280.94,
      "text": "Like I just want a big ass screen.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08764508744360695,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.5205106054447248e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6947040498442367
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 281.09999999999997,
      "end": 285.65999999999997,
      "text": "But the size of the videos are not actually all that bigger than a regular slab phone.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08764508744360695,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.5205106054447248e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6947040498442367
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 285.74,
      "end": 290.32,
      "text": "It's always disappointing that when I pop this thing open, there's so much wasted screen area from the black bars.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08764508744360695,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.5205106054447248e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6947040498442367
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "start": 290.5,
      "end": 293.71999999999997,
      "text": "It does get better if you rotate it, but it's just not a massive difference.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08764508744360695,
      "no_speech_prob": 1.5205106054447248e-12,
      "compression_ratio": 1.6947040498442367
    },
    {
